      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. The logging approach makes sense, but since this is an embedded system, I can't easily use std::cout or heavy logging without affecting the real-time timing. \n\nCan you explain more about the specific issue in the code I sent? If you look closely at that processPacket function, is there a specific reason why the memory might not be returning to the heap correctly during the resize?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
